### 1. Register a new user
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "confirm_password": "password123",
  "full_name": "Test User"
}

### 2. Login (Sets HTTPOnly cookies)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Get Current User Details
GET http://localhost:8000/api/auth/me/
Accept: application/json

### 4. Verify Email (requires Auth cookie)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/verify-email/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "123456"
}

### 5. Resend Verification Code (requires Auth cookie)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/verify-email/resend/
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Upload Avatar (Multipart form-data)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/avatar/
# Note: Actual file upload via HTTP client requires attaching the file.
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatar"; filename="avatar.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test_avatar.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

### 7. View Presents (Guest access allowed)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/gifts/?page=1&items_per_page=10&sort_by=price_low
Accept: application/json

### 8. Filter Presents
GET http://localhost:8000/api/gifts/?category=Toys&gender_target=Kids&max_price=50
Accept: application/json

### 9. View Current User's Wishlists
GET http://localhost:8000/api/wishlists/
Accept: application/json

### 10. Create a new Wishlist
POST http://localhost:8000/api/wishlists/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "My Birthday List"
}

### 11. Add a gift to the Wishlist (Assuming wishlist ID 1 and present ID 1)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/wishlists/1/manage-item/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "present_id": 1,
  "action": "add"
}

### 12. Export Wishlist to CSV
GET http://localhost:8000/api/wishlists/1/export/csv/

### 13. Logout (Clears cookies)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/logout/
Content-Type: application/json
